  "method": "A big game is both teams among the 68 schools on this desk (Power 4 plus Notre Dame) and at least one team in the AP top 25. The bigger spender is the school with the higher FY2025 EADA football expense. The checkbook wins when that school wins the game. A game moves the record only after it is final. An unplayed or in-progress game stays upcoming and does not get a winner, a score, or a biggerSpenderWon flag. Gap is the difference between the two filed expense totals. Equal spend is not in this book.",
